{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_18","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/sh -lc 'python .codex/skills/memory-log/scripts/append_memory.py --help; cat ../final_evaluation/final_manifest.json; cat results/ideas/01_capacity_versus_decay_clock_in_width_dependent_grokking/program_1/src/EXPERIMENT_SCOPE.md; cat ../final_evaluation/invocation.json; /home/agent-home/.codex/tmp/arg0/codex-arg01Wi7zG/apply_patch --help'","aggregated_output":"usage: append_memory.py [-h] [--write-conclusions] [--event-json EVENT_JSON]\n                        [--event-file EVENT_FILE]\n                        [--local-memory-md LOCAL_MEMORY_MD]\n                        [--global-memory-md GLOBAL_MEMORY_MD]\n                        [--global-memory-jsonl GLOBAL_MEMORY_JSONL]\n                        [--conclusions-md CONCLUSIONS_MD]\n                        [--conclusions-history-jsonl CONCLUSIONS_HISTORY_JSONL]\n                        [--conclusions-text CONCLUSIONS_TEXT]\n                        [--cycle-index CYCLE_INDEX]\n                        [--worker-index WORKER_INDEX]\n                        [--gate-trigger GATE_TRIGGER]\n                        [--gate-reason GATE_REASON]\n\nAppend one memory event, or atomically rewrite conclusions.md.\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n  --write-conclusions   Switch into conclusions-write mode (validates and\n                        replaces conclusions.md).\n  --event-json EVENT_JSON\n                        Event payload as JSON object string\n  --event-file EVENT_FILE\n                        Path to event JSON file\n  --local-memory-md LOCAL_MEMORY_MD\n                        Local workspace memory markdown path\n  --global-memory-md GLOBAL_MEMORY_MD\n                        Global markdown memory path (event mode)\n  --global-memory-jsonl GLOBAL_MEMORY_JSONL\n                        Global JSONL memory path (event mode)\n  --conclusions-md CONCLUSIONS_MD\n                        Path of c